  },
  {
    "id": 4901026240040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "携帯用のものがあるということを、\r\n今回初めて知ってね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490102624/4901026240040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901026240050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタは外出の機会も多いから──\r\n役に立つかもしれないと思ったんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490102624/4901026240050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すごいなぁ、しゃれてるよ……！\r\nさすが咲耶だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901026240060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "やめてほしいな\r\nこれでも緊張しながら選んでいるんだよ？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490102624/4901026240060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901026240070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、当たり前じゃないか",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490102624/4901026240070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901026240080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "まだまだ社会というものを知らない私から\r\n大人のアナタに贈るんだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490102624/4901026240080"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901026240090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "不安にならない方がおかしいというものだろう？\r\nだから──",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
